#! rate=44118 block=128 tracks=4
# 05 The first step's lock order, and Stop (Movy's side of docs/13 D2, D6).
# After Play, and after a bar launch, the entered step's locks follow its
# note-ons in the same tick; on later steps a lock leads its step by one
# clip tick. Stop sends nothing for the lanes, which stay at their last lock;
# Play then re-sends from step 0.
@0 tog 0 0 60 100
@0 tog 0 8 62 100
@0 alabel 0 0 synth:cutoff
@0 abaseq 0 0 40
@0 aset 0 0 0 100 1
@0 aset 0 0 4 20 1
@0 clipsel 0 1
@0 tog 0 0 67 100
@0 aset 0 0 0 5 1
@0 clipsel 0 0
@0 play
@27000 stop
@30000 play
@40000 launch 0 1
@125000 stop
